m>\n      <title>Repeated Bitcoin profit taking near $77K suggests rally is losing steam</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 22:25:10 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 22:25:10 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/repeat-bitcoin-profit-taking-near-77k-suggests-rally-is-loosing-steam</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/repeat-bitcoin-profit-taking-near-77k-suggests-rally-is-loosing-steam?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwQmxvY2tjaGFpbiUyMGluZHVzdHJ5JTIwc2hvd3MlMjBzaWducyUyMG9mJTIwc3RhYmlsaXppbmclMjBoZWFkaW5nLmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" alt=\"Repeated Bitcoin profit taking near $77K suggests rally is losing steam\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Short-term traders took profit each time BTC rallied above $77,000, creating overhead sell pressure that has capped BTC’s ability to reach $80,000.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Biraajmaan Tamuly</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwQmxvY2tjaGFpbiUyMGluZHVzdHJ5JTIwc2hvd3MlMjBzaWducyUyMG9mJTIwc3RhYmlsaXppbmclMjBoZWFkaW5nLmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwQmxvY2tjaGFpbiUyMGluZHVzdHJ5JTIwc2hvd3MlMjBzaWducyUyMG9mJTIwc3RhYmlsaXppbmclMjBoZWFkaW5nLmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n    