e for Delio CEO over $169M crypto fraud</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 13:32:51 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 13:32:51 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/south-korea-seeks-20-year-sentence-for-delio-ceo-over-169m-crypto-fraud</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/south-korea-seeks-20-year-sentence-for-delio-ceo-over-169m-crypto-fraud?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL2FycmVzdCUyMGNyaW1lJTIwY29wJTIwaGFjayUyMHRoaWVmJTIwYXJyZXN0ZWQlMjBwb2xpY2UlMjBhc2lhbi5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" alt=\"South Korea seeks 20-year sentence for Delio CEO over $169M crypto fraud\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Prosecutors say Jeong Sang-ho’s “active deceptive acts” left nearly 2,800 investors frozen out of their funds, as South Korea's crackdown on the crypto industry widens.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Amin Haqshanas</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL2FycmVzdCUyMGNyaW1lJTIwY29wJTIwaGFjayUyMHRoaWVmJTIwYXJyZXN0ZWQlMjBwb2xpY2UlMjBhRedirecting...\n<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8' ?>\n<rss\n  version=\"2.0\"\n  xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\"\n  xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\"\n  xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\"\n  xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\"\n  xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\"\n  xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\"\n  xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\"\n  xmlns:snf=\"http://www.smartnews.be/snf\"\n>\n  <channel>\n    <title>Decrypt</title>\n    <description>What&amp;#039;s new in crypto and the advent of the decentralized web.</description>\n    <language>en</language>\n    \n    <atom:link\n      href=\"https://decrypt.co/feed\"\n      rel=\"self\"\n      type=\"application/rss+xml\"\n    />\n    \n    \n      \n        <link>https://decrypt.co/feed</link>\n      \n    \n    \n      <copyright>Decrypt Media</copyright>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <lastBuildDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 11:55:19 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Morning Minute: MegaETH&#39;s MEGA Debut Biggest of 2026</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366299/morning-minute-megaeths-mega-debut-biggest-of-2026</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 11:55:19 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>MegaETH just debuted the biggest token of 2026 to date, while Kalshi is now officially a top-five U.S. sportsbook.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Tyler Warner</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366299</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-megaeth-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Opinion</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-megaeth-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin Closes April Up 12% as Strategy&#39;s MSTR Posts First Positive Month Since July</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366297/bitcoin-closes-april-up-12-as-strategys-mstr-posts-first-positive-month-since-july</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 11:47:53 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Bitcoin rallied 12% in April as Strategy added $4.1 billion in BTC, but on-chain data suggests gains may be speculative.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Akash Girimath</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366297</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/bitcoin-decrypt-style-30-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Coins</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/bitcoin-decrypt-style-30-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>South Korean Court Lifts Bithumb&#39;s Six-Month Business Suspension</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366292/south-korean-court-lifts-bithumbs-six-month-business-suspension</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 10:32:10 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>A Seoul court has reversed March sanctions that would have restricted the exchange&#39;s core functions over alleged compliance failures.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366292</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Judge-decrypt-style-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Judge-decrypt-style-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Mistral AI Drops New Open-Source Model. The Internet Is Not Impressed, Except for One Thing</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366275/mistral-ai-open-source-model-agents-internet-not-impressed</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 21:31:03 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Mistral Medium 3.5 is the rare Western entry in the open-source top tier, but it costs multiples more than Chinese rivals that beat it on benchmarks.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366275</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ai-agents-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ai-agents-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Elon Musk Says xAI Used OpenAI Models to Train Grok</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366274/elon-musk-xai-used-openai-models-train-grok</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 20:52:43 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The admission in federal court is a rare acknowledgment of the use of distillation techniques as AI firms compete to build more capable and cheaper models.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366274</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-elon-musk-5-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-elon-musk-5-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin Crash Incoming? April Surge Was Built on Shaky Ground, Analysts Warn</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366267/bitcoin-crash-incoming-april-surge-built-shaky-ground-analysts-warn</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 20:30:19 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Analysts warn that the Bitcoin rally was fueled by speculative futures trading, mirroring conditions that preceded the 2022 crypto crash.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366267</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-27-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-27-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenAI Rolls Out Advanced Account Security for ChatGPT Users</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366262/openai-advanced-account-security-chatgpt-users</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 19:51:43 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>OpenAI&#39;s new opt-in security feature requires passkeys, limits recovery options, and excludes chats from training.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366262</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-openai-logo-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-openai-logo-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Ubuntu Linux Is Adding AI Features—Its Users Are Worried</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366247/ubuntu-linux-adding-ai-features-users-worried</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 19:33:26 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Canonical announced plans to bake AI into Linux&#39;s most popular distro. The community that chose Ubuntu specifically to avoid this kind of thing was not thrilled.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366247</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/decrypt-style-ai-robots-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/decrypt-style-ai-robots-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Senate Votes to Ban Senators and Staff From Using Prediction Markets</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366243/senate-votes-ban-senators-staff-using-prediction-markets</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 19:16:38 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>S. Res. 708 prohibits senators and staff from using prediction markets, and became effective immediately upon passage.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366243</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/us-capitol-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/us-capitol-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>North Korean Hackers Have Stolen $6 Billion in Crypto—Including 76% of 2026&#39;s Spoils: TRM</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366241/north-korean-hackers-stolen-6-billion-crypto-trm</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 18:42:53 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Pyongyang-linked hackers drained $577 million from two DeFi platforms in April, underscoring an escalating threat to crypto markets.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366241</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/dprk-north-korea-hacker-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/dprk-north-korea-hacker-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenAI Finally Explains Why ChatGPT Wouldn&#39;t Stop Talking About Goblins</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366197/openai-explains-chatgpt-mention-goblins</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 18:16:37 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Why did OpenAI have to write &#34;never mention goblins&#34; into its production code on ChatGPT? The company has published a post-mortem.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366197</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-ai-goblin-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-ai-goblin-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Agentic Memory: Walrus Takes On AI&#39;s Next Big Bottleneck</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365834/agentic-memory-walrus-takes-on-ais-next-big-bottleneck</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 17:31:07 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Long-term memory limits what AI agents can do. Walrus is going after it with MemWal plus new OpenClaw and NemoClaw integrations.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Staff</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365834</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/NemoClaw-2-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/NemoClaw-2-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Crypto Is the Most Muted Topic on Elon Musk’s X, Ahead of Politics: Product Head</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366176/crypto-most-muted-topic-elon-musk-x-product-head</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 17:21:05 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Internal data shows users mute crypto more than politics and global conflict on X’s For You feed.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366176</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/twitter-X-logo-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Technology</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/twitter-X-logo-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Polymarket Launches Market Integrity Tools Following Soldier’s Insider Trading Arrest</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366177/polymarket-launches-market-integrity-tools-following-soldiers-insider-trading-arrest</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 17:11:02 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The team-up between Polymarket and Chainalysis aims to bring institutional-grade compliance monitoring to crypto prediction markets.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366177</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/decrypt-style-polymarket-01-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/decrypt-style-polymarket-01-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>MegaETH Token Launches as Ethereum Layer-2 Network&#39;s Novel Rewards System Is Tested</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366164/megaeth-token-launches-ethereum-layer-2-novel-rewards-system</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 16:26:01 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Ethereum layer-2 network MegaETH will unlock its native MEGA token over time, and reward it to users, as key benchmarks are met.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Sander Lutz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366164</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/ethereum-decrypt-style-07-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Coins</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/ethereum-decrypt-style-07-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Twenty-One Weighs Mergers With Strike, Elektron to Create Publicly Traded Bitcoin Giant</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366165/twenty-one-weighs-mergers-strike-elektron-publicly-traded-bitcoin-giant</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 15:46:25 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Tether Investments proposed a three-way merger to create a Bitcoin platform combining mining, treasury management, and financial services</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366165</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-26-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-26-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Gemini Gains Key CFTC Approval to Expand Prediction Market, Perps Offerings</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366159/gemini-cftc-approval-expand-prediction-market-perps-offerings</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 15:02:13 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>A DCO license will now allow crypto exchange Gemini to act as a clearinghouse for its derivatives-related businesses.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Sander Lutz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366159</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/gemini-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/gemini-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Morning Minute: Bitcoin Falls After Powell&#39;s Likely Final FOMC</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366109/morning-minute-bitcoin-falls-after-powells-likely-final-fomc</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 13:48:15 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>No rate cuts are coming any time soon, Big Tech earnings gave AI bulls more to work with, and Meta is back in crypto payments with USDC creator payouts.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Tyler Warner</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366109</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/J-Powell-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Opinion</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/J-Powell-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Google and Microsoft Just Proved the AI Trade Is Alive—While OpenAI Is Sweating</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366100/google-microsoft-ai-trade-openai-revenue-estimates</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 22:14:49 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Alphabet and Microsoft crushed Q1 estimates on the same day, with Google Cloud up 63% and Microsoft&#39;s AI business hitting a $37 billion run rate.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366100</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/stock-chart-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/stock-chart-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"901\" width=\"1600\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Labor Department Launches AI Apprenticeship Portal as Trump Admin Continues AI Policy Push</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366097/labor-department-ai-apprenticeship-portal</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 21:22:39 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The Labor Department unveils an online hub to help workers and employers build AI skills amid a quickly changing jobs market.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366097</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/us-capitol-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/us-capitol-decrypt-style-02-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Mayo Clinic Says AI Can Detect Pancreatic Cancer Years Before Human Doctors</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366095/mayo-clinic-says-ai-can-detect-pancreatic-cancer-years-before-human-doctors</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 21:01:08 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The AI model analyzes subtle tissue changes on routine CT scans invisible to human specialists, detecting pancreatic cancer up to three years earlier than doctors can.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366095</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ai-healthcare-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Health</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/ai-healthcare-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Key Senator Pushes for Vote on Clarity Act—But Hurdles Remain</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366090/key-senator-clarity-act-vote-hurdles-remain</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 20:31:47 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Thom Tillis, a swing GOP vote on the Senate Banking Committee, says his colleagues should take up a months-delayed vote on the crypto bill.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Sander Lutz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366090</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/us-capitol-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/us-capitol-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Meta Launches USDC Stablecoin Creator Payouts on Solana and Polygon via Stripe</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366087/meta-launches-usdc-stablecoin-creator-payouts-on-solana-and-polygon-via-stripe</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 20:10:14 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Facebook and Instagram parent company Meta is now offering stablecoin payouts to content creators in certain countries.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Andrew Hayward</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    c2lhbi5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL2FycmVzdCUyMGNyaW1lJTIwY29wJTIwaGFjayUyMHRoaWVmJTIwYXJyZXN0ZWQlMjBwb2xpY2UlMjBhc2lhbi5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>UK regulator clears path for tokenized funds within existing rules</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 13:27:56 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 13:27:56 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/uk-regulator-clears-path-tokenized-funds-within-existing-rules</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/uk-regulator-clears-path-tokenized-funds-within-existing-rules?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL3BlYWNlX2FuZF9mcmllbmRzaGlwLmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" alt=\"UK regulator clears path for tokenized funds within existing rules\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The FCA signs off rules to let UK funds keep registers onchain and add a new Direct‑to‑Fund dealing model, aiming to simplify tokenized funds inside the existing regime.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Christina Comben</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL3BlYWNlX2FuZF9mcmllbmRzaGlwLmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL3BlYWNlX2FuZF9mcmllbmRzaGlwLmpwZz9wcmVmaXg9bWVkaWElMkZhcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Did Bitcoin bottom versus gold? BTC price will reach $167K in 2027 if history repeats</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 13:20:23 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 13:20:23 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/markets/gold-fractal-raises-bitcoins-odds-of-rising-180-in-a-year</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/markets/gold-fractal-raises-bitcoins-odds-of-rising-180-in-a-year?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwV2hhdCUyMGlzJTIwdGhlJTIwc3RvY2slMjB0byUyMGZsb3clMjByYXRpbyUyMG9mJTIwQml0Y29pbi5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" alt=\"Did Bitcoin bottom versus gold? BTC price will reach $167K in 2027 if history repeats\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Bitcoin’s 40% rebound against gold signals a potential bottom, echoing past setups that preceded strong BTC/USD rallies.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Yashu Gola</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwV2hhdCUyMGlzJTIwdGhlJTIwc3RvY2slMjB0byUyMGZsb3clMjByYXRpbyUyMG9mJTIwQml0Y29pbi5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJJTIwV2hhdCUyMGlzJTIwdGhlJTIwc3RvY2slMjB0byUyMGZsb3clMjByYXRpbyUyMG9mJTIwQml0Y29pbi5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Markets</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>US gov’t sues four states, RWAs cross $30 billion: Month in Charts</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 13:00:00 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/features/us-govt-sues-four-states-rwas-cross-30-billion-month-in-charts</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/features/us-govt-sues-four-states-rwas-cross-30-billion-month-in-charts?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLVdFRi1yZXBvcnQtc3VnZ2VzdHMtd29tZW4tdW5kZXJyZXByZXNlbnRlZC1pbi1ibG9ja2NoYWluJTJDLXBvaW50cy10by1zb2x1dGlvbnMtMi5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" alt=\"US gov’t sues four states, RWAs cross $30 billion: Month in Charts\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The US CFTC has sued four states for trying to enforce state-level gambling laws on prediction markets, meanwhile Strategy stacked over 56,000 BTC.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Aaron Wood</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLVdFRi1yZXBvcnQtc3VnZ2VzdHMtd29tZW4tdW5kZXJyZXByZXNlbnRlZC1pbi1ibG9ja2NoYWluJTJDLXBvaW50cy10by1zb2x1dGlvbnMtMi5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9wYXlsb2FkLmx1bS10cmkub3JnL2FwaS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9maWxlL0hJLVdFRi1yZXBvcnQtc3VnZ2VzdHMtd29tZW4tdW5kZXJyZXByZXNlbnRlZC1pbi1ibG9ja2NoYWluJTJDLXBvaW50cy10by1zb2x1dGlvbnMtMi5qcGc/cHJlZml4PW1lZGlhJTJGYXJ0aWNsZS1jb3ZlcnM=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Features</category>\n    </item>\n  </channel>\n</rss>\n<guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366087</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/meta-logo-decrypt-style-1-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/meta-logo-decrypt-style-1-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Celsius Founder Alex Mashinsky Banned From Crypto Industry in $10 Million FTC Settlement</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366077/celsius-founder-alex-mashinsky-banned-crypto-industry-10m-ftc-settlement</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 19:39:10 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The settlement represents a massive reduction from an initial $4.7 billion judgment against the Celsius founder.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366077</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/celsius-alex-mashinsky-decrypt-style-scaled-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>celsius-degree-token</category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/celsius-alex-mashinsky-decrypt-style-scaled-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1440\" width=\"2560\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>This AI Was Trained Only on Pre-1930 Text. We Asked It About Hitler, Stocks, and the Future</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366015/talkie-1930-ai-model-pre-1931-training-hitler-stocks</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 19:38:03 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Talkie-1930 is a 13-billion-parameter model that has never heard of the internet, World War II, or modern politics. The results are fascinating, funny, and occasionally unsettling.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366015</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/old-talkie-ai-1930s-gID_4.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/old-talkie-ai-1930s-gID_4.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>White House Weighs Reinstating Anthropic for Federal Use Amid Pentagon Fight: Report</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366010/white-house-weighs-reinstating-anthropic-federal-use</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 18:32:34 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Trump officials reportedly drafted guidance to help agencies access Anthropic’s AI, including Claude Mythos, despite Pentagon restrictions.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366010</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/decrypt-style-anthropic-claude-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/decrypt-style-anthropic-claude-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin, Ethereum Dip as Fed Holds Rates Steady for Third Straight Time</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/366008/bitcoin-ethereum-dip-fed-holds-rates-steady-third-straight-time</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 18:14:42 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Wednesday&#39;s FOMC meeting was expected to be Jerome Powell’s last as Federal Reserve chair.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=366008</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/J-Powell-1-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/J-Powell-1-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Tether Stakeholder Gave Farage Undisclosed $6.7M Gift Amid Reform UK Crypto Funding Scrutiny</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365990/tether-farage-undisclosed-gift-reform-uk-crypto-funding</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 17:29:11 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The personal gift to the Reform UK leader from billionaire Christopher Harborne comes amid scrutiny over crypto industry political funding.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Stephen Graves</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365990</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/nigel-farage-reform-uk-decrypt-style-03-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/nigel-farage-reform-uk-decrypt-style-03-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>OpenAI Sued Over Failure to Warn Police Before Tumbler Ridge Mass Shooting</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365986/openai-sued-failure-warn-police-tumbler-ridge-mass-shooting</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 16:38:48 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>A California lawsuit could test whether AI companies have a legal duty to report violent threats after a mass shooting in British Columbia.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365986</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-sam-altman-2-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-sam-altman-2-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Canadian Government Pushes for Sweeping Ban on Bitcoin, Crypto ATMs</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365983/canadian-government-pushes-sweeping-ban-bitcoin-crypto-atms</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 16:20:39 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The country hosts nearly 4,000 crypto ATMs, second only to the U.S.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365983</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/bitcoin-atm-crack-decrypt-style-scaled-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/bitcoin-atm-crack-decrypt-style-scaled-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1440\" width=\"2560\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>MoonPay Launches Institutional Division, Acquires Crypto Key Management Firm Sodot</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365975/moonpay-launches-institutional-division-sodot-acquisition</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 15:20:43 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Crypto payments processor MoonPay is expanding into institutional services with a veteran regulator at the helm.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365975</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-moonpay-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/decrypt-style-moonpay-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Polymarket Eyes US Return for Crypto Exchange as Lone CFTC Chair Weighs Approval</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365970/polymarket-eyes-us-return-for-crypto-exchange-as-lone-cftc-chair-weighs-approval</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 15:01:02 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>With four of five CFTC commissioner seats vacant, the decision on whether to lift Polymarket&#39;s U.S. ban rests with Chair Michael Selig alone.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Vince Dioquino</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365970</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/michael-selig-cftc-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>polygon</category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/michael-selig-cftc-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Visa Adds Base, Polygon, Canton, Arc and Tempo to Stablecoin Settlement Program</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365968/visa-base-polygon-canton-arc-tempo-stablecoin-settlement-program</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 14:43:32 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Payments giant Visa scales its blockchain settlement infrastructure with five new networks as pilot program shows 50% quarterly growth.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365968</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/visa-logo2-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/visa-logo2-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"900\" width=\"1600\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Computershare Taps Securitize to Tokenize Thousands of Company Stocks on Wall Street</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365960/computershare-taps-securitize-tokenize-thousands-companies-wall-street</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 14:33:26 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The BlackRock-backed firm was recently selected as by the New York Stock Exchange as a tokenization specialist.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365960</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/decrypt-style-wall-street-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/decrypt-style-wall-street-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin&#39;s Upside Capped by $82K Sell Wall as UAE’s OPEC Exit Triggers Risk Sell-Off</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365942/bitcoins-upside-capped-by-82k-sell-wall-as-uaes-opec-exit-triggers-risk-sell-off</link>\n  <pubDate>Wed, 29 Apr 2026 13:44:51 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Multiple $3.3 million sell walls sit between $80,400 and $82,000 as oil volatility and rising real rates keep Bitcoin trapped.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Akash Girimath</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365942</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/bitcoin-oil-decrypt-style-1-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/bitcoin-oil-decrypt-style-1-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n  </channel>\n</rss>\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\" standalone=\"yes\"?><rss version=\"2.0\" xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\"><channel><generator>NFE/5.0</generator><title>\"bitcoin crypto\" - Google News</title><link>https://news.google.c